WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
- So, wait, you are about to
be, this is literally my kids',

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.650
like one of their favorite
characters all the time

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.200
is Ursula, and you're about to do this

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.870
in the live action "The Little Mermaid".

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:08.703
- Yes.

00:00:08.703 --> 00:00:10.267
- Are you so stoked? I mean,
you have the best song,

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:11.690
"Poor Unfortunate Souls", yeah.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.673
- It's so weird because
when I was a nanny,

00:00:13.673 --> 00:00:18.350
I worked for this lovely,
the Ross family, hi Rosses!

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.580
And we watched "The Little
Mermaid" almost every night.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.581
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:22.581 --> 00:00:24.800
- So I truly was like, for
three years I watched it

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.827
almost every night.

00:00:25.827 --> 00:00:26.660
- Yeah.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.010
- And to get to play it and to work with,

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.517
like, Rob Marshall.

00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:30.519
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:31.580
- And just the whole,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.480
because I don't get to be in your world,

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.900
of like singing and sliding
down a clamshell, and.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.733
- [Kelly] I know.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:38.480
- Truly. The clamshell was like, you know,

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.313
the size of a house, I was like.

00:00:39.313 --> 00:00:40.146
- I know but you have the best song!

00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:42.090
Did you feel so powerful
singing that song?

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:43.488
- I was scared to death.

00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:45.670
And then I worked with somebody,

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.550
and then I was like, okay,
it's just a character.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.460
I don't have to be, I
don't have to be a singer.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.440
I can just be this character.
But I love that song.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:54.273
And when it.
- Me too.

00:00:54.273 --> 00:00:55.960
- When we finally recorded
it and they're like,

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.270
that's it, you've got your song.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:59.810
I literally burst out
crying 'cause I was like,

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.770
I don't get to go to
singing class anymore.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.603
Like, that's it?

00:01:02.603 --> 00:01:04.401
- You don't get to go to
singing class, that's hilarious.

00:01:04.401 --> 00:01:05.420
- It'd be weird if you kept,

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.040
if you kept going it would be odd.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:07.873
- That would be weird.

00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:09.830
Not your Friday night dress
up in a box of chocolates?

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:12.000
I was like, that's your line?

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:12.870
- That's mine.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.170
- [Kelly] We found it.
Yeah, I was like, okay.

